{"ID":"20240219110837-z7wfuan","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","icon":"2b50","id":"20240219110837-z7wfuan","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240219110837-z7wfuan\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240305084520-m3yydg9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312101229-vhpqnzy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:5184,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312101348-t542jdn\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:102,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:102\u0026#125;","title":"笔记","type":"doc","updated":"20240906134501"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240221134207-pfljrv4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221134207-pfljrv4","updated":"20240221145259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"1、伤寒，出自难经第五十八难；（伤于寒的五种病：中风、伤寒、湿温、热病、温病）"}]},{"ID":"20240221134207-0q4skko","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221134207-0q4skko","updated":"20240221145032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、疫病：冬天本来就是冷的，那你在冷的状态之下得到寒症，那你得到的是正气的病，这是一般的病，你如果是得到非正气的病，冬天本来应该是很冷的，结果你是很温热的，气候跟节气不和，冬行春令，这个时候你发现男女老少，不管他是谁，得到的症都一样，这就是所谓疫病，具有传染性。"}]},{"ID":"20240221144949-z1kvrie","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221144949-z1kvrie","updated":"20240221163839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2.1、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"学习伤寒时，针对病症开出的处方可以分为两种，一种是正气得到的病，一种是时疫得到的病；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240221134208-j61a76x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221134208-j61a76x","updated":"20240227104557"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3、经方并不是张仲景研究出来的，张仲景是经方的传承人；他把古圣先贤的方子拿下来，跟六经辨证，告诉我们如何按照这个辩证的手法，如何按照这个症，辩证的方式来下处方。"}]},{"ID":"20240221144815-80l13hp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221144815-80l13hp","updated":"20240227101946"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3.1、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"经方是绝对处方，经典之方；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240227103113-hp12ntc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227103113-hp12ntc","updated":"20240227103127"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3.2、经方的比例是黄金比例，如对症，勿改；"}]},{"ID":"20240227105420-g4vn20l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227105420-g4vn20l","updated":"20240227105457"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3.3、对症时使用经方无效，要考虑是否是用量太轻，加重药味配伍试试；"}]},{"ID":"20240221134208-eoicvgg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221134208-eoicvgg","updated":"20240221145905"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"4、五运六气——十二时辰分六气；（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"亥巳厥阴、子午少阴、丑未太阴、寅申少阳、卯酉阳明、辰戌太阳"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"）"}]},{"ID":"20240221145537-tzkurwx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221145537-tzkurwx","updated":"20240221145537"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 329px;","style":"width: 319px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240221145537-f1f7tuq.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 319px;\" parent-style=\"width: 329px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240221150522-28mz366","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221150522-28mz366","updated":"20240221151306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"4.1、六气会流动，顺时针流动代表正常，逆时针流动代表生病；（所以治病有疗效时是以顺时针呈现症状，反之病情恶劣是以逆时针呈现症状）"}]},{"ID":"20240221134208-yvjjpgh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221134208-yvjjpgh","updated":"20240221153149"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"5、八纲辨证：阴阳表里虚实寒热；"}]},{"ID":"20240221153150-qomdc76","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221153150-qomdc76","updated":"20240227100434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"6、太阳脉："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"浮、沉、迟、数"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"四大主脉（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"浮数为阳脉，沉迟为阴脉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"）；"}]},{"ID":"20240221153823-r1k0xx7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221153823-r1k0xx7","updated":"20240221155024"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"6.1、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"浮脉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：手轻轻的摸到皮肤上，就摸到脉，那就是浮脉。"}]},{"ID":"20240221153754-vjmlmm3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221153754-vjmlmm3","updated":"20240221155025"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"6.2、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"沉脉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：重按到才能摸到的脉，就是沉脉；"}]},{"ID":"20240221154032-i1irqd5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221154032-i1irqd5","updated":"20240221155027"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"6.3、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"迟脉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：跳的速度慢的脉；（每一息脉跳动不足四次）"}]},{"ID":"20240221154050-3rzt2yv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221154050-3rzt2yv","updated":"20240221155028"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"6.4、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"数脉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：跳的速度快的脉；（脉来急速，一息五至以上）"}]},{"ID":"20240221154841-jkujw1i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221154841-jkujw1i","updated":"20240221155029"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"6.5、拓展——"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"滑脉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：手指搭在脉上，就像有一排气泡一样；"}]},{"ID":"20240221154911-wiakr7l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221154911-wiakr7l","updated":"20240221155057"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"6.6、拓展——"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"涩脉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：脉来艰涩，如轻刀刮竹，滞涩不滑利；"}]},{"ID":"20240221155032-2raslk0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221155032-2raslk0","updated":"20240221155452"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"6.7、拓展——"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"弦脉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：如按琴弦，重则如按弓弦，甚至如循刀刃；"}]},{"ID":"20240221153952-mb2a39i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221153952-mb2a39i","updated":"20240221154635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"7、摸脉时，如摸到浮大或浮滑或浮速的脉，要以浮脉为基准（阳脉），如治疗后脉象变为涩脉，如涩微、涩弦（阴脉），说明病在进；反之，如脉一开始为浮涩或浮沉，治疗后脉象变为浮大或浮速，说明病在退，治疗有效；"}]},{"ID":"20240221162049-u3kafjl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221162049-u3kafjl","updated":"20240221162201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"7.1、常人的脉：不浮不沉不迟不数；"}]},{"ID":"20240221154635-cxqe0he","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221154635-cxqe0he","updated":"20240221163940"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"8、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"中风"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：汗出恶风脉缓或有发烧症状，都可以称之为中风；（这是中医定义的中风，与西医定义的全身瘫痪中风不同）"}]},{"ID":"20240221134208-l1j1o16","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221134208-l1j1o16","updated":"20240221163745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"8.1、中风症状的发烧，温度不会太高，可能比正常人高个一两度；"}]},{"ID":"20240221164014-6n3zzx7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221164014-6n3zzx7","updated":"20240221164109"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"8.2、中风不是病名，而是症状；"}]},{"ID":"20240221163746-9mk3upu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221163746-9mk3upu","updated":"20240222113639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"9、太阳病，有汗中风用桂枝配伍，无汗伤寒用麻黄配伍；"}]},{"ID":"20240221164556-wm8px1f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221164556-wm8px1f","updated":"20240222114220"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"10、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"所有的痛都是来自压力，并不是来自发炎；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240221170742-jg5axsj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221170742-jg5axsj","updated":"20240222113736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"11、肠胃好的人不容易有病（以通为补）；"}]},{"ID":"20240301094755-5i7i2f7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240301094755-5i7i2f7","updated":"20240301094757"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"11.1、绝大多数贫血都便秘，清便秘，大便一正常，胃口一恢复，补血药还没开，光吃饭血就补回来了"}]},{"ID":"20240221134208-anem2gx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221134208-anem2gx","updated":"20240222114123"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"12、伤寒论中的一日为六天左右，六天或七天；"}]},{"ID":"20240221134209-qhsq582","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221134209-qhsq582","updated":"20240222114535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"13、病传的原因很多。绝大多数病会传经的原因在于心脏。心脏有两种，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"一种是心藏神"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，情志上如心情不好导致的传经，心情好则不会传；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"一种是心脏功能受到影响"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，如服用抗生素导致病邪传经；"}]},{"ID":"20240222114510-1tpahtv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240222114510-1tpahtv","updated":"20240222114826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"14、舌为心表；"}]},{"ID":"20240222114826-lhjkhd8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240222114826-lhjkhd8","updated":"20240222144046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"15、太阳症只有三个病："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"中风、伤寒、温病"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，三者各有各的处方；"}]},{"ID":"20240227141732-3rhlazf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227141732-3rhlazf","updated":"20240227141737"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"15.1、太阳中风桂枝汤，太阳伤寒麻黄汤。太阳温病葛根汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240222142940-32tg0zd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240222142940-32tg0zd","updated":"20240222143234"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"16、冬伤于寒，春必温病；温病实际上是伤寒后潜藏于内，然后在阳气生发时引发的病症；"}]},{"ID":"20240221134209-k4n0te8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221134209-k4n0te8","updated":"20240222143915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"17、以二十四个节气来计算，从霜降，即农历九月份中旬到隔年夏至之前，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"从霜降以后进入冬天开始冷，得到的是伤寒，隔年到春天到夏至以前，发出来的热病，热症，就是叫做温病"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，在夏至以后就看不到温病了。夏至以后就是暑热，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"热症"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"还有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"湿热"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"这两种。"}]},{"ID":"20240221134210-56onabn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221134210-56onabn","updated":"20240222144612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"18、汗尿同源；"}]},{"ID":"20240222144613-9eiw10i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240222144613-9eiw10i","updated":"20240222144924"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"19、平常喝的水，进入胃是直接被胃热气化掉了；吃的食物中包含的水分，则是通过消化进入血液循环中；"}]},{"ID":"20240226171022-2lf5woq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240226171022-2lf5woq","updated":"20240226171032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"19.1、详解：在中医得观念里面，饮水入胃，胃的火就会把水汽化掉，因为你喝的是水，如果是食物入胃，胃咀嚼后到小肠，小肠是火，本来是相火，所以小肠会把食物消化掉，这个食物的残渣再进入大肠，大肠里面有水还有残渣，小肠的火在下面烧，水在上面走，这个水气化掉以后回到肺里面，这个水才能止渴。"}]},{"ID":"20240228094250-flgbczp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240228094250-flgbczp","updated":"20240228094303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"19.2、正常人，食物到胃，进入小肠，小肠是火很热，把食物分解掉，分解掉进入大肠只剩下水和食物的残渣，水在上面，小肠火在下面烧，水回头到肺里面，这是肺最好的津液。你如果没有经过这个管道，喝水，喝下去就跑掉了，根本不会经过小肠，大肠。所以有的人渴饮千杯不能止渴，所以肺里面的水一定要从食物里面的水来；"}]},{"ID":"20240222144924-r0w8z51","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240222144924-r0w8z51","updated":"20240222145406"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"20、脸色发黄有很多原因，需详细辩证而治：如失血导致的黄，肝胆的黄，血液失水隔着皮层呈现的黄，脾胃疾病不能受纳营养导致的黄等；"}]},{"ID":"20240222145334-f74og4w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240222145334-f74og4w","updated":"20240222150348"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"21、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"太阳病如不治疗，病邪会传经到阳明经，所以可以在7天传经前扎阳明经本穴足三里，这样能使病邪不传经而治愈；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240222150343-1c57769","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240222150343-1c57769","updated":"20240222153005"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"22、阳病恢复时是在中午，阴病恢复时是在半夜；"}]},{"ID":"20240222153023-qw5ezm3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240222153023-qw5ezm3","updated":"20240222153205"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"22.1、所以脏有病的时候都是半夜胃气恢复。腑有病，就是消化系统有病的时候，都是中午的时候胃气会恢复。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"胃气恢复的特征，感觉饿"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20240222152113-yt1ai5k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240222152113-yt1ai5k","updated":"20240222153737"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"23、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"真寒假热："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"寒在骨髓，热在皮肤；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"真热假寒："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"热在骨髓，寒在皮肤；"}]},{"ID":"20240221134210-sk51ipj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221134210-sk51ipj","updated":"20240222163435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"24、张仲景伤寒论没有‘阴虚’的概念，只讲"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"阴盛和阴亡。阳盛和阳亡。阴盛就是实，阳盛就是虚。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240221134210-otkp9ap","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221134210-otkp9ap","updated":"20240222163335"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"25、补药都是要在身体健康的情况下吃的；"}]},{"ID":"20240221134210-9euibn3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221134210-9euibn3","updated":"20240222163610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"26、张仲景从伤寒到金匮，大概百分之六十的处方都是桂枝汤在做加减。桂枝汤是调和阴阳的第一方；"}]},{"ID":"20240229162418-3ctffkf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229162418-3ctffkf","updated":"20240229162446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"26.1、桂枝汤能调和营卫，能补津液，常喝桂枝汤对身体有益；"}]},{"ID":"20240222163610-185omdp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240222163610-185omdp","updated":"20240222164919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"27、伤寒金匮中，主要是三类药剂："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"汤剂、散剂、丸剂；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240222163944-gedjfty","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240222163944-gedjfty","updated":"20240222164918"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"27.1、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"汤剂"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"主扫荡；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"散剂"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"主四肢久病、病居无常处、表里游走；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"丸剂"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"药缓力专；"}]},{"ID":"20240222164500-wzs8o0c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240222164500-wzs8o0c","updated":"20240222164532"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"27.2、大火快煮用其‘气’，小火慢煮用其‘质’；"}]},{"ID":"20240222163723-9yz141q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240222163723-9yz141q","updated":"20240222170939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"28、张仲景用生甘草是针对脾胃的，用炙甘草则是针对心脏；"}]},{"ID":"20240222170940-h8vb848","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240222170940-h8vb848","updated":"20240226095900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"29、表症里症同时存在时，先解表，再攻里（有例外，例一个礼拜没大便了，攻表跟攻里的药要同时开在一起。）"}]},{"ID":"20240226095007-piirkty","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240226095007-piirkty","updated":"20240226100257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"30、治里症或表症有三法：汗、吐、下三法；"}]},{"ID":"20240226101403-i4uae77","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240226101403-i4uae77","updated":"20240226101506"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"30.1、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"汗"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：病在表；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"吐"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：病在上膈；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"下"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：病在下焦；"}]},{"ID":"20240226101537-ytktvwz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240226101537-ytktvwz","updated":"20240226101801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"30.2、如三法皆用无效，可能存在严重的问题，知犯何逆，随症治之；"}]},{"ID":"20240226101425-3pf2dgs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240226101425-3pf2dgs","updated":"20240226163326"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"31、酒客、喘家、吐家，不可直接使用桂枝汤，需与相应中和的药物配伍，就酒家配伍顾护脾胃的药；"}]},{"ID":"20240226105549-njm7mzp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240226105549-njm7mzp","updated":"20240227184418"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"32、麻黄汤下去并不一定会发汗，可能会从小便排出；"}]},{"ID":"20240226113852-ff8gu2y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240226113852-ff8gu2y","updated":"20240228162118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"33、治心脏病、祛痰都不用白芍的；（因为白芍味酸苦，酸苦涌泄为阴。如果我们把阴当成静脉，桂枝是动脉的时候，你把白芍拿掉，血流回心脏的速度就会减缓下来，就会让心脏得到喘息。所以胸满者一律不用白芍，可用枳实，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"如会用枳实一定能治好心脏病"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"。）"}]},{"ID":"20240221134210-0qo104x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221134210-0qo104x","updated":"20240226115611"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"33.1、胸满定义很广，包括你气呼不过来，你胸口心脏满，胸口痛，刺痛统统叫胸满；"}]},{"ID":"20240221134210-rkehi9q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221134210-rkehi9q","updated":"20240226153140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"34、麻黄用的时候用的是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"茎"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，把"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"节"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"去掉，因为麻黄的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"茎是发汗"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"的，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"节是止汗"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"的；"}]},{"ID":"20240226153028-u7pkv27","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240226153028-u7pkv27","updated":"20240226170352"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"35、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"太阳症传入‘阳明"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"’"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，阳明有两种情况：一种白虎（经热）；一种承气（腑热）；"}]},{"ID":"20240221134210-wrxwpyu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221134210-wrxwpyu","updated":"20240305154450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"35.1、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"阳明经热"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"时，表现症状为大渴（非常的渴），喜欢喝冰的；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"阳明腑热"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"时，表现的症状为便秘；（简言之:"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"经热为大渴，腑热为便秘"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，经热用白虎。腑热用承气汤。）"}]},{"ID":"20240221134210-qkq320s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221134210-qkq320s","updated":"20240226170535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"35.2、不管经热还是腑热，阳明无死症，但热不寒；（有例外，用错药致死）"}]},{"ID":"20240226170339-1i8hjy6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240226170339-1i8hjy6","updated":"20240226171504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"36、张仲景会在顾护病人的津液不伤到或已经伤的很重的时候用到人参；"}]},{"ID":"20240226171504-1y0ehia","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240226171504-1y0ehia","updated":"20240226172640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"37、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"单味麻黄是没法发汗的，但吃了精神会亢奋；麻黄能发汗是通过配伍其他药如桂枝实现；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240226172635-80zbeou","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240226172635-80zbeou","updated":"20240226173356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"38、肺色白主魄主静，如人烦躁不安，可能是魄不守，石膏色白，白虎汤可镇之，让胸阳回头；"}]},{"ID":"20240226173451-03cpcgq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240226173451-03cpcgq","updated":"20240226173508"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"38.1、所以石膏不仅能够去热，还能敛阳，尤其是肺阳；"}]},{"ID":"20240226173327-q1dzmrw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240226173327-q1dzmrw","updated":"20240226173715"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"39、心下，一般指的是胃；"}]},{"ID":"20240226173715-3w4hpny","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240226173715-3w4hpny","updated":"20240227083449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"40、白术可去湿，茯苓可利水；白术+茯苓可消导湿气；"}]},{"ID":"20240227083354-aeohx0d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227083354-aeohx0d","updated":"20240227090720"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"41、身体的热量来源于心脏搏动的热，其中脚离心脏最远，所以心脏有问题时，初期第一反应在脚上；（脚冷代表心脏有问题）"}]},{"ID":"20240227090539-buzmeuv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227090539-buzmeuv","updated":"20240227091040"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"41.1、脚冷，都会有淤血，当用药把脚热起来，热量会把淤血融化掉（血活了，自然淤也就化掉了）；"}]},{"ID":"20240227090803-qn87oke","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227090803-qn87oke","updated":"20240227090822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"41.2、所以西方医学在治疗感冒的时候，吃抗生素，一吃下去心脏伤到，心脏伤到后心脏产生的热就没有办法导到脚，所以脚是冷的。"}]},{"ID":"20240227090318-gresbbj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227090318-gresbbj","updated":"20240227091641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"42、四逆不是从脚指头到脚环裸，是从脚指头到膝盖头，是从手指头到手肘，而不是从手指到手掌；"}]},{"ID":"20240227091643-1yz6v4u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227091643-1yz6v4u","updated":"20240227091716"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"42.1、手指到手掌的冰冷，不叫四逆，叫手脚冰冷；"}]},{"ID":"20240227091716-vkbs8wf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227091716-vkbs8wf","updated":"20240227092911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"43、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"药弗瞑眩疾不瘳"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：在中医里面，吃了中药以后，没有产生瞑眩，病不会好，在经方用的时候，常常瞑眩，你只要是对症，都会头昏（这是好事）；"}]},{"ID":"20240227092833-wvzpdf8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227092833-wvzpdf8","updated":"20240227094623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"44、芒硝，可用于攻坚，一般来说是生用。有两种生用方法：一种是煮完以后还有一点点火在里面，汤还在滚，芒硝倒下去，让它消化在里面，马上关火。另一种是芒硝直接放到碗里面去，然后汤直接倒下去，让他化掉。"}]},{"ID":"20240227094346-rm341z7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227094346-rm341z7","updated":"20240227094453"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"44.1、后者取其迅捷药气，如果需要排大便很快的给它排掉，我们会用这种方式；前者药性会稍微缓和一点；"}]},{"ID":"20240304170535-2xl99ag","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240304170535-2xl99ag","updated":"20240304170603"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"44.2、芒硝可用于攻肿瘤，便秘；"}]},{"ID":"20240221134210-eanmfpa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221134210-eanmfpa","updated":"20240227095644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"45、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"生附子纤维很多，煮的时候尽量用棉布包起来，不然喝药喉咙沾到纤维，可能会发痒造成剧烈咳嗽"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20240227095447-ii8ghbd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227095447-ii8ghbd","updated":"20240227095534"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"45.1、附子一枚生的和干的重量相差较大，所以用附子时一般计量单位为‘一枚’；"}]},{"ID":"20240227095702-o8ueyyd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227095702-o8ueyyd","updated":"20240306082836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"45.2、生附子常用于里寒，炮附子常用于表虚（也能壮里阳）；"}]},{"ID":"20240227190708-ts7519n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227190708-ts7519n","updated":"20240227190919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"45.3、生附子能温心阳（所以四逆汤用的是生附子，增强心脏搏动力量，自然热量能传导四肢）；命门火衰也用生附子；肾阳不足，用炮附子；"}]},{"ID":"20240305114906-wz61x50","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305114906-wz61x50","updated":"20240305115425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"45.4、汗血是同源，汗尿也同源，有的人失血过多，尿失禁，还是可以用炮附子；"}]},{"ID":"20240221134210-kfog5nr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221134210-kfog5nr","updated":"20240227100916"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"46、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"张仲景设计葛根汤最主要的目的其实就是治疗温病；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240227101103-8i17lww","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227101103-8i17lww","updated":"20240227101112"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"46.1、温病：最常见的就是小孩子，外面很冷，小孩子运动，流汗，表开得到感冒，这个大多数都是葛根汤症；"}]},{"ID":"20240227100912-wcm492p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227100912-wcm492p","updated":"20240227101811"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"47、中医在治病的同时不管什么病，一定同时固他的肠胃（常见用红枣）；"}]},{"ID":"20240220170101-mh6g62p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240220170101-mh6g62p","updated":"20240227103850"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"48、鼻窦炎分两种，浊涕，清涕；"}]},{"ID":"20240227104203-uqiz375","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227104203-uqiz375","updated":"20240227104243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"49、痛风，脚膝关节红肿，"}]},{"ID":"20240227104431-i3du09c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227104431-i3du09c","updated":"20240227112335"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"50、术附汤和当归赤豆散都有一个别名叫排脓汤，术附汤应用面广，排身体各处包括深处脓疡，当归赤豆散则是专门排痔疮脓疡；"}]},{"ID":"20240227112336-wrgexz1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227112336-wrgexz1","updated":"20240227143124"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"51、「太阳」舆「阳明」合病,必自下利,「葛根汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240227143055-yortyfs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227143055-yortyfs","updated":"20240227143058"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"51.1、「太阳」与「阳明」合病,喘而胸满者,不可下,宜「麻黄汤」。"}]},{"ID":"20240227112836-p5wylgz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227112836-p5wylgz","updated":"20240227113009"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"52、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"小柴胡汤是介于太阳和少阳之间的处方，大柴胡汤是介于阳明和少阳之间的处方；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240227112839-91upb32","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227112839-91upb32","updated":"20240227113309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"53、治痢思路：葛根汤把水气上提；使用药物进行和解；利尿把水里出来，自然止痢；"}]},{"ID":"20240227114111-qj6ycxo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227114111-qj6ycxo","updated":"20240227114130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"54、生半夏无味，吃了人会失声；"}]},{"ID":"20240227114234-dheuzpo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227114234-dheuzpo","updated":"20240227114315"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"54.1、生半夏涤水力量非常强，可以去脑部积水；所以去至高水可用生半夏，恶心也可用生半夏；"}]},{"ID":"20240227113309-dw50jbd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227113309-dw50jbd","updated":"20240227114239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"54.2、生姜能解半夏毒；如果制过的半夏，用姜半夏，用了姜半夏就不需要再加生姜解毒了；"}]},{"ID":"20240227113711-9fbefdd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227113711-9fbefdd","updated":"20240227115248"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"55、葛芩连汤的时候，黄芩黄连剂量是相等的。黄芩跟黄连有点差异，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄连"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"仔细看很黄味道很厚很重，是土，黄连是苦味，它清理胃里面的东西，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄芩"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"也是黄，但是带有点绿色，所以肝胆的湿热，小肠的湿热黄芩用的很多；"}]},{"ID":"20240227115225-3wkquv0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227115225-3wkquv0","updated":"20240227115740"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"56、问诊，问有没有汗，可以判断患者肠胃功能和心脏功能是否正常（心主汗液）；心脏功能很好，你运动才会出汗，你走路才会出汗，你吃饭才会出汗，心脏功能不好，一种是完全没有汗，一种是你不动就会流汗，不该出汗的时候出汗。"}]},{"ID":"20240227115844-3dunazo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227115844-3dunazo","updated":"20240227115902"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"56.1、肾脏功能不行的时候，治肾脏一定要治心脏；"}]},{"ID":"20240227115924-93fc3wp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227115924-93fc3wp","updated":"20240227115941"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"56.2、病人有汗，就不容易有水肿或积水；"}]},{"ID":"20240227115742-jx8bsad","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227115742-jx8bsad","updated":"20240227141142"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"57、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黄不止能发表流汗，还有将阳气生发起来的作用，所以麻黄汤也叫做返魂汤；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240227141144-ead1f5h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227141144-ead1f5h","updated":"20240227141227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"57.1、大陆经方家李可用两三百克炮附子回阳救逆，其实麻黄汤也能达到这种效果；"}]},{"ID":"20240227135621-pj67xzp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227135621-pj67xzp","updated":"20240227192034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"58、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"经方遇到病人阴虚，开强阳的药，阳强后阴自回；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240227192035-lyi2i0l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227192035-lyi2i0l","updated":"20240227192102"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"58.1、张仲景在补阴滋阴的时候，他就是用人参，生姜、甘草、芍药就够了，看不到其他的药，张仲景经方的观念一直是把身体阳气恢复，代表脏腑的功能恢复以后，希望阴液自回，而不是补阴的药给你。补阴的药给病人，身体会退化；"}]},{"ID":"20240227135758-z5x5o8k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227135758-z5x5o8k","updated":"20240227141129"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"59、善用麻黄的人，所有的咳嗽，气喘，肺上面的问题，还有救逆都可以处理。"}]},{"ID":"20240227141228-6vksa1a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227141228-6vksa1a","updated":"20240227154727"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"60、大青龙汤是张仲景为疫病而设立的处方；"}]},{"ID":"20240227162723-uka37q0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227162723-uka37q0","updated":"20240227162847"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"60.1、大青龙汤除了治疗时疫以外，身上湿很盛、水肿的人，也能用大青龙汤排；"}]},{"ID":"20240227154727-tjcp9vy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227154727-tjcp9vy","updated":"20240227154849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"61、在麻桂青龙三脚鼎力，麻黄汤、桂枝汤、葛根汤都是按照节气，就是春天是温暖的，夏天是热的，秋天是凉的，冬天是寒的，这个节气正常运作的时候得到的病就是桂枝汤、麻黄汤、葛根汤。你如果是春行冬令，或者是夏行秋令，或者冬行春令，节气不对的时候就发生时疫，就是用到大青龙了。"}]},{"ID":"20240227154850-tafyhxz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227154850-tafyhxz","updated":"20240227163323"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"62、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"大青龙汤是表寒里热，烦躁；小青龙是表寒里寒，主症发热而咳；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240227163411-4ztcbf3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227163411-4ztcbf3","updated":"20240227163627"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"62.1、当你看到表寒里寒的时候，就可以开小青龙汤了。（即发热恶寒、脉浮无汗、痰白、舌苔白、口不渴）"}]},{"ID":"20240227163809-ckly468","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227163809-ckly468","updated":"20240227163823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"62.2、平常没有喘，夏天，天气热的时候开始喘，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"大青龙汤症"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；平时没有喘，冬天天一冷开始喘，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"小青龙汤症"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240227165120-zw59bpr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227165120-zw59bpr","updated":"20240227165215"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"62.3、喉咙痒，是标准的小青龙汤证；（喉咙痒、一说话就咳嗽）；"}]},{"ID":"20240227163016-bh7l6e8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227163016-bh7l6e8","updated":"20240227165355"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"63、方剂配伍中，只要病人感觉口渴，方剂一律不用半夏；可加味瓜蒌根止渴；"}]},{"ID":"20240304174051-6gqepm4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240304174051-6gqepm4","updated":"20240304174056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"63.1、现在市面上你去买写栝蒌根或者天花粉，他拿给你的东西是一样的，如果我们真正去追究，实际上是有点差异，现在人不太讲究；"}]},{"ID":"20240304174514-z4t4dgu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240304174514-z4t4dgu","updated":"20240304174521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"63.2、肺的津液伤到，心和肺都在上焦，胸是诸阳之汇，因为血在这里交换，肺里面是气，肺里面的气像天上的云雾一样，肺气的来源就是大肠气化以后上来，所以这个水是非常好的水，这个水是可以进入血脉里，栝蒌根就是补肺里面的水，栝蒌根拿出来也是白色的，天花粉也是白色入肺。石膏是胃热，栝蒌根是肺热。"}]},{"ID":"20240227165302-7qi9ibs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227165302-7qi9ibs","updated":"20240227165750"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"64、小青龙汤本身是不渴的，因为有里寒。吃完药以后，口渴了，想喝水了，寒去掉了。服汤已,渴者,此寒去欲解也。光是这句，我们延伸了很多地方，比如你治了一个病人，肾脏病的人，肾脏病尿毒、积水，肾脏衰竭的人，都不口渴的。吃了你的药，又流汗，又口渴，这就是病要好了。所以口渴和胃气恢复是相同的结果。里寒去掉了，渴就出现了。"}]},{"ID":"20240227154725-3fayqpj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227154725-3fayqpj","updated":"20240227170143"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"65、受病者："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"初者"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":",病邪初起,正气尚强,邪气尚浅,则"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"宜速攻"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"中者"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":",受病较久,邪气渐深,正气渐弱,"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"宜攻兼扶"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"末者"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":",病已经久,邪气侵凌,正气消残,"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"宜扶正气"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240227165913-zci3nmj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227165913-zci3nmj","updated":"20240227170236"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"66、张仲景在扶正气的时候，病很深的时候，也不会用滋阴的药，强补的药，最重的时候用到人参。"}]},{"ID":"20240227170400-oa132am","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227170400-oa132am","updated":"20240227170440"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"66.1、为什么观念是这样？把你的病治好了，然后你去吃食物，吃了食物以后，产生了营养，自己身体吸收了，恢复起来，这才是真正的痊愈的定义。病可以治的，方法要这样才对。而不能说食物吃不下没关系，用多种维他命给它吃。"}]},{"ID":"20240227170235-30dt2os","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227170235-30dt2os","updated":"20240227171422"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"67、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"厚朴白术都能祛湿，两者区别？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"厚朴能去脾湿，把脾脏的湿搬到小肠里去，小肠能够增润津液是源于厚朴；白术也是去湿，但去全身关节肌肉里的湿，中焦里的湿它也去，所以白术用的时候用到茯苓，你如果白术不用到茯苓的时候，湿不会完全去掉。白术加上茯苓，湿就会从小便解掉；"}]},{"ID":"20240227171501-e9bcl7j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227171501-e9bcl7j","updated":"20240227171527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"67.1、处方中如有白术茯苓，代表着希望身体的湿从小便解掉；"}]},{"ID":"20240227171151-4i56jdm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227171151-4i56jdm","updated":"20240227184208"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"68、小孩阳气旺，所以常常容易流鼻血，常留鼻血的小孩不容易发高烧；（但是年长的人，如在没有脉浮紧发热的症状下还流鼻血，可能是其他问题，需留意）"}]},{"ID":"20240227172243-o0a957n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227172243-o0a957n","updated":"20240227182012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"69、从营卫角度来看，中风伤卫，伤寒营卫皆伤（所以麻黄汤中有麻黄和桂枝）；"}]},{"ID":"20240227181852-fger3gt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227181852-fger3gt","updated":"20240227181902"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"69.1、卫是气，营是血；"}]},{"ID":"20240227183352-zaplkww","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227183352-zaplkww","updated":"20240227183649"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"69.2、营行脉中，卫行脉外，营卫调和则病愈，而桂枝汤可以调理营卫；"}]},{"ID":"20240227181828-e0oxuxy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227181828-e0oxuxy","updated":"20240227183115"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"70、病人吃麻黄汤没有动悸，这个人心脏很好，心脏不好的时候，你麻黄汤一下去，心脏就开始跳加速。所以你也可以用这个做个标准判断病人心脏健康状态；"}]},{"ID":"20240227183116-at1l8kq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227183116-at1l8kq","updated":"20240306110544"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"71、伤寒论有三个承气汤：调胃承气汤，小承气汤，大承气汤；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"胃下方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"十二指肠这一段，就是调胃承气汤的时候。堵在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"小肠"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"里面，会用小承气，堵到"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"大肠"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"里面的时候，我们才会用到大承气。"}]},{"ID":"20240227184927-zf0pw7b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227184927-zf0pw7b","updated":"20240227184927"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 159px;","style":"width: 149px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240227184927-sywcmtg.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 149px;\" parent-style=\"width: 159px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240227185052-bs4p3qs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227185052-bs4p3qs","updated":"20240227185057"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"71.1、三个有个共同的现象，就是小便是黄的。因为里面是热，很干燥，所以最明显是小便。攻的时候什么时候停止就问他小便的颜色，小便是清色、淡黄就可以停了，代表好了，里面宿便没有了。"}]},{"ID":"20240306105936-vdaajc5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240306105936-vdaajc5","updated":"20240306111313"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"71.2、阳明方：大黄甘草汤（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"胃中"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"实症，朝食暮吐）、调味承气汤（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"胃下"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"十二指肠堵到，中脘穴到肚脐有压痛）、小承气汤（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"小肠"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"堵到，大肠空的导致不断排气的症状，关元穴有压痛）、大承气汤（大肠堵到，小便黄，多天便秘，不排气，天枢穴有压痛）；"}]},{"ID":"20240306113918-uruzerd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240306113918-uruzerd","updated":"20240306114642"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"71.3、拓展：大便梗到阑尾，用大黄牡丹皮汤；如用药过慢导致阑尾破裂变成腹膜炎，当归赤豆散（赤小豆要用发芽的）；"}]},{"ID":"20240306113959-7yg6ptg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240306113959-7yg6ptg","updated":"20240306114643"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"71.4、拓展：妈妈回家，儿子躲到哪吓她，有的人是发奔豚，有的不是，大便梗到这边，大肠这边有一个血管，直接络到肝脏，一紧张，干燥的大便顶到血管这边来，当干燥大便顶到（肝脏）这边，有一个特殊的症状会出现，叫肠子中间有水气。病人便秘，这个地方痛，你压他肚子，一压咕噜咕噜水声很多，不是大承气，也不是小承气，这是受惊吓发的，用己椒苈黄丸，防己、椒目、葶苈子、大黄，做成丸剂，外面三钱的芒硝在汤里面，丸剂吞下去，芒硝汤冲下去，把这个大便打掉。一打掉整个大便大下。但是这个一定要用丸剂。"}]},{"ID":"20240306114633-ge59ahq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240306114633-ge59ahq","updated":"20240306114720"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"71.5、拓展：脾约型便秘，大便一颗颗如羊粪，麻子仁丸；"}]},{"ID":"20240306114842-pqu19j3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240306114842-pqu19j3","updated":"20240306115208"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"71.6、拓展：大肠头、盲肠位置堵到，压痛，右下腹隐隐作痛（这一块破裂堵到的时候，手上左手的生命线有一个开心果那么大的紫斑。）：薏苡附子败酱散；"}]},{"ID":"20240227184929-p9vrxgt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227184929-p9vrxgt","updated":"20240227185220"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"72、一般承气汤症，大便堵到的话头痛都在印堂；"}]},{"ID":"20240227185218-pnr4s45","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227185218-pnr4s45","updated":"20240227185347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"73、如果有便秘，我们给桂枝汤来解表比给麻黄汤解表要好，这是一个大原则。"}]},{"ID":"20240227185417-9vffbp3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227185417-9vffbp3","updated":"20240227185420"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"73.1、临床上的时候，不要顾虑那么多，你知道他是麻黄汤，但是大便堵到六七天，小便是黄的，知道里面是承气汤症，那先解表还是先攻里，不要想那么多，人体很奥妙的，你把承气汤跟麻黄汤开在一起都没有关系，我就碰过这样子，那你怎么办，如果你是碰到两三天，先解表再攻里嘛，没有那么急。已经六七天了，算了，不要那么急，两个开在一起，结果开在一起的时候，两个同时好。为什么可以这样子做，刚开始还没有。因为美国人你给他说，这个药你先吃，吃完再吃这个，结果他忘掉了，回去两个药放在一起煮，结果表里同时解掉了。后来我们知道这个可以同时用，没有那么严格。"}]},{"ID":"20240227185348-l3r9plq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227185348-l3r9plq","updated":"20240227190214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"74、怎么判断上吐下泻以后病邪还在不在？很简单，这是一个技巧，当你吐、下以后，病去了没有，就是渴，病人说非常口渴，不要再给他药了，病好了。如果没有口渴，不行，再吃。"}]},{"ID":"20240227190158-z6rsty1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227190158-z6rsty1","updated":"20240228091946"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"75、大青龙汤中，石膏与杏仁合起来的剂量一定要与麻黄剂量等——经方是黄金比例；"}]},{"ID":"20240228092047-bohucjt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240228092047-bohucjt","updated":"20240228092117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"75.1、如病人高烧重，咳嗽痰不多，石膏用到五钱，麻黄还是六钱，杏仁一钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240228091809-wlnoqi3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240228091809-wlnoqi3","updated":"20240228095323"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"76、心下悸治疗思路：肚脐左边肝，脐中间是脾，脐右边是肺，脐上方有动悸是从肾脏下手治疗，脐左边有动悸从肝脏下手治疗，脐下方有动悸是从心脏下手治疗，肚脐右边有动悸从肺脏开始下手。"}]},{"ID":"20240228093253-a96z4ch","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240228093253-a96z4ch","updated":"20240228093259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 170px;","style":"width: 160px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240228093016-wye5msk.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 160px;\" parent-style=\"width: 170px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240228093301-jozoibg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240228093301-jozoibg","updated":"20240228094727"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"76.1、水和水气不相等，水气是我们身上所受用的，水我们身上不受用；意思是这个水的冷的，寒的，水气是热的；意思是这个水的冷的，寒的，水气是热的；如果水冲上来后，就会有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"动悸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"的现象；"}]},{"ID":"20240228094634-ufii90j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240228094634-ufii90j","updated":"20240228095242"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"78、麻黄汤太过导致心下悸，用桂枝甘草汤；桂枝汤太过导致脐下悸，用桂枝甘草茯苓大枣汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240228095242-cmye4at","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240228095242-cmye4at","updated":"20240228100146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"79、腹胀，虚胀跟实胀，最简单的区别方式就是问小便，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"小便淡白虚胀，小便很黄实胀"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240228100803-z9ofagn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240228100803-z9ofagn","updated":"20240228100823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"79.1、虚胀：厚朴生姜半夏甘草人参汤；实胀：承气汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240228100146-ind9gr1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240228100146-ind9gr1","updated":"20240228100513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"80、下痢也有可能是因为便秘引起的；"}]},{"ID":"20240228100502-yue0y1c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240228100502-yue0y1c","updated":"20240228100649"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"80.1、手去按天枢周围，病人拒按，这是承气汤症，便秘引起的下痢，大便堵在大肠，很硬，只有旁边小缝隙可以通过，肠子里面的水排出来了，大便排出不出来，造成一天上十几二十次厕所，排出来都是水，这个是因为便秘引起的下痢。还有一种也是大便堵到，旁边排不过，只有中间一个小缝隙可以排过，这个大便排出来细细长长的，这是便秘造成的，也是承气汤症。"}]},{"ID":"20240228100326-7t1vpcv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240228100326-7t1vpcv","updated":"20240228103640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"81、病人脚是热的，就不会有心脏病；"}]},{"ID":"20240228103640-joi58mc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240228103640-joi58mc","updated":"20240228105333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"82、经方家在处方的时候不会开纯补的药在里面，一定是补泻兼顾的药。这样子新陈代谢才会回到正常，不能老是只开补药。"}]},{"ID":"20240228105333-nytrii0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240228105333-nytrii0","updated":"20240228110238"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"83、只要出现但热不寒，就是阳明症；"}]},{"ID":"20240228110238-i3c9g2o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240228110238-i3c9g2o","updated":"20240228110738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"84、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"艾滋病初期呈现症状是阳明白虎汤证，阳明无死症，但吃了西药之后就变成了厥阴证，所以艾滋病如果没有西医动过就用白虎汤；所以我很肯定病人是死在西药上面，不是死在 HIV 上面。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240228110412-c6dlgmi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240228110412-c6dlgmi","updated":"20240228111057"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"85、调胃承气汤证：可在下脘、建里穴找到压痛点；"}]},{"ID":"20240228111057-6bg147b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240228111057-6bg147b","updated":"20240228111243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"86、麻黄汤是宣肺的药，肺里面的津液散掉。桂枝汤才会影响到小肠，肠胃的津液。"}]},{"ID":"20240228111244-cxtdbhm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240228111244-cxtdbhm","updated":"20240228115445"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"87、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"五苓散"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"常见于治疗瘟疫的时候使用，一发现得了瘟疫，可以先用五苓散对治；"}]},{"ID":"20240228112006-342jtin","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240228112006-342jtin","updated":"20240228112012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"87.1、五苓散能把皮肤表面的病毒导到小便里面排掉，五苓散的功能跟汗解的功能完全是相反的路径。"}]},{"ID":"20240228115358-991itb7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240228115358-991itb7","updated":"20240228115442"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"87.2、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"泽泻"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"利全身水；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"茯苓"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"利中焦的水，就是心蔽骨和肚脐中间的地方；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"猪苓"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"是利下焦，肚脐以下的水。"}]},{"ID":"20240228140336-jpk30y1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240228140336-jpk30y1","updated":"20240228140338"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"87.3、比如有病人吃过桂枝汤、麻黄汤没有得汗，皮肤身上很痒，汗没有透发，皮肤会痒。怎么处理？五苓散把它利掉，痒就没有了。"}]},{"ID":"20240228141448-ygxpyy7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240228141448-ygxpyy7","updated":"20240228141550"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"87.4、喝水太快，容易使水隔在横隔或中焦，造成五苓散证，饮水则吐；"}]},{"ID":"20240228111248-wlkoqfo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240228111248-wlkoqfo","updated":"20240228112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"88、一般肚脐以上有水肿的时候，是以汗解，下半身积水，是以尿解；"}]},{"ID":"20240228112149-u5psgy7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240228112149-u5psgy7","updated":"20240228142720"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"89、「栀子豉汤」常用于人病愈了以后，没办法睡觉，「栀子豉汤」是去虚烦用的。"}]},{"ID":"20240228142720-sbcqnql","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240228142720-sbcqnql","updated":"20240228161646"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"90、厚朴是专门对腹部胀满用的，不管里面是什么肝硬化腹水，只要感觉腹部胀满，对症就用；"}]},{"ID":"20240228161633-ybwlsac","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240228161633-ybwlsac","updated":"20240228163823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"91、心脏病用枳实。枳实能治疗心烦。当人身上，心跟小肠相表里，枳实可以帮助小肠，大肠，宽肠，所谓宽肠的意思就是说枳实能够让东西变大。比如胆管太小，我们让枳实撑开来。间接帮到了心；中医为什么可以治疗胆结石。胆汁出来是喷射状的，因为心脏不断的在搏动，心脏产生的热从心脏直接进入小肠。心脏的搏动会影响胆，所以胆汁好像喷香水一样喷出来。如何强心脏，重用炙甘草，心脏跳的力量会加强，然后柴胡，有湿热黄芩，枳实可以宽胆，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"这个处方已经是可以治胆结石的处方了。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"五倍子，海金沙，这个能消除结石。枳实可以把缩小的变大。胆管、包括我们的大肠小肠，尤其是大肠，宿粪在里面堵到，枳实下去会撑开来，为什么？就是因为枳实管心脏。枳实长得就像心脏，心脏搏动，枳实下去会跟着心脏的样子搏动，会造成大肠小肠蠕动增加。"}]},{"ID":"20240228162318-84lmd7d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240228162318-84lmd7d","updated":"20240228164536"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"92、桂枝能通冲脉。桂枝能够降逆，降逆就是气往上冲，桂枝能够把它压下来，加上白术茯苓把这个湿排掉，所以苓桂术甘汤是治疗中膈的水饮。"}]},{"ID":"20240228164658-9dw6gjs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240228164658-9dw6gjs","updated":"20240228164807"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"92.1、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"苓桂术甘汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"是治疗中膈的水饮；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"真武汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"是温中除寒；"}]},{"ID":"20240228164514-2z8r8h3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240228164514-2z8r8h3","updated":"20240228165842"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"93、湿伤于下，比如久坐湿地。居住的地方比较潮湿，身体就会从下面开始伤到的，在这种情况生活的人身体湿很盛；脚呈现容易没有力、风湿关节炎等症状；"}]},{"ID":"20240228165615-2rf7ya6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240228165615-2rf7ya6","updated":"20240228170127"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"94、不管是甘草还是炙甘草，它有蓄水的功能。所以我们津液不够的时候，我们会用甘草生津；所以排水的药中不含甘草，如五苓散、真武汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240228170128-jbclcyj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240228170128-jbclcyj","updated":"20240228170226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"95、咽喉干燥者,不可发汗。"}]},{"ID":"20240228170258-l7y90m3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240228170258-l7y90m3","updated":"20240228170303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"95.1、咽喉在黄帝内经里面是三阴之汇，三阴：太阴、少阴、厥阴。咽喉干燥，代表阴津不够。讲阴就是讲血。这个时候不可以发汗，因为汗血同源；"}]},{"ID":"20240228170304-eaup3vw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240228170304-eaup3vw","updated":"20240228171833"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"96、形瘦的人都是里寒，形胖的人都是有湿热的；"}]},{"ID":"20240228171834-320twk2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240228171834-320twk2","updated":"20240228173507"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"97、寸是诊胸的位置，尺是诊腹的位置，中间就是关。阳脉（寸）微者，先汗出而解；阴脉（尺）微者,下之而解；"}]},{"ID":"20240229082704-fk8139w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229082704-fk8139w","updated":"20240229083155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"98、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"太阳病邪有两种进势，一种是病入阳明，病就不会再进了，一种是病入少阳，如果没处理好，就会病进至太阴、少阴乃至厥阴；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240229082806-h2abfso","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229082806-h2abfso","updated":"20240229083149"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"99、少阳就是我们的三焦系统。上焦、中焦、下焦。也就是西医讲的淋巴系统。所有的脏跟腑之间，有黄油膜，统统属于三焦。奇恒之腑，包括脑、乳房、胸、女子胞，都是列入三焦。"}]},{"ID":"20240229083150-ytjjatm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229083150-ytjjatm","updated":"20240229083930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"100、病好的原则，睡好，一觉到天亮。大便正常。胃口好。小便颜色正常。体力恢复。脚温热。这些代表肝病完全好。"}]},{"ID":"20240229083156-mj87sto","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229083156-mj87sto","updated":"20240229084031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"101、肝癌两年前就知道了，不管你在什么地方，当地时间，晚上一点到三点准时醒过来，肝就已经出问题了。那个时候就要下手治了。"}]},{"ID":"20240229084131-c85k6io","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229084131-c85k6io","updated":"20240229084158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"101.1、不要等到两年以后，原来肝炎的时候，只是湿热。等到变成很实的时候，就长东西。中医为什么分虚实寒热，只是湿热不是实症在里面，很好治。等里面是实症的时候，你要把实症去掉就很难了。实症如果是在腑里面，比如说是大肠小肠胃胆，都不难。在脏里面就很难清了。"}]},{"ID":"20240229090204-4h4agkt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229090204-4h4agkt","updated":"20240229090213"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"101.2、治肝的时候，肝象木，木要疏。郁金能疏郁气。半夏把水排掉，树只有树根可以在水里面，要是上面在水里面，树会淹死。"}]},{"ID":"20240229090253-lz4dgmt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229090253-lz4dgmt","updated":"20240229090410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"101.3、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"小柴胡汤预防肝病效果甚好；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240229091939-urvsc8o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229091939-urvsc8o","updated":"20240229091953"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"101.4、如果遇到三焦，淋巴癌的病人，有淋巴结的地方长的是硬块、肿块，我开处方是小柴胡汤。三焦的淋巴是黄色的，三焦就是油脂，黄色的。会有结，有实在，看到长东西都是实，这个时候，我们会用一些黄色的去实的药，比如硫磺。我们用生硫磺，因为硫磺很热，它能把实去掉。所以小柴胡汤光是加一个硫磺，一下三焦系统就清的很干净。如果头昏，脑部有积水，很大，生半夏加重，生半夏可以排脑部的积水。如果说是乳癌，也是用柴胡汤做加减。月经来的时候，女孩子月经是心脏在管。所以心脏很好，月经一定很正常。心脏在管奶水，中医认为奶水就是月经，当月经来的时候，如果乳房有硬块，正在吃乳癌的处方，正好碰到月经。我们用桂枝下去，柴胡汤加桂枝，因为桂枝可以降逆冲脉，把奶水导到子宫里面去。"}]},{"ID":"20240229084033-cdrydyl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229084033-cdrydyl","updated":"20240304164357"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"102、包括女人月经痛，你用小柴胡汤给他，小柴胡汤是在经方里唯一一个处方，就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"当女人月经来的时候，你得到感冒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，不管太阳中风、伤寒、温病，你要你月经来得到感冒"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"一律小柴胡汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"。肚子痛用白芍，胸满用枳实。白芍加重，加重到五钱、一两，看她痛到什么程度。"}]},{"ID":"20240229084159-8oirkbw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229084159-8oirkbw","updated":"20240229094527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"103、服「柴胡汤」已,渴者,属「阳明」也,以法治之。（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"渴跟胃气恢复有雷同的功能"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，这里指少阳病退至阳明）"}]},{"ID":"20240229094303-rdhv0hw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229094303-rdhv0hw","updated":"20240229094649"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"103.1、病退阳明，是好转的现象；再依症治之；如渴有小便不利是五苓散。如果大渴烦躁，大便正常，有壮热是白虎汤。有便秘渴承气汤等；"}]},{"ID":"20240229094357-8pn1kdc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229094357-8pn1kdc","updated":"20240306150833"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"104、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"如果三阳并病，太阳、阳明、少阳证皆有的情况，和解少阳，用担法，用小柴胡汤；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240229095605-92o0xu8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229095605-92o0xu8","updated":"20240229095945"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"105、小孩子肚子痛，很皮，就是不吃饭，看他的脸，两眼中间鼻根处，青黑的一条就是小建中汤症。肚子里寒的嘛，所以就不喜欢吃东西。"}]},{"ID":"20240229095853-86jxwb3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229095853-86jxwb3","updated":"20240229101456"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"106、呕家不可用建中汤,以甘故也。"}]},{"ID":"20240229101415-euqnxsk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229101415-euqnxsk","updated":"20240229102543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"107、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"太阳兼少阳症，小柴胡汤；阳明兼少阳症，大柴胡汤；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240229102539-g76e15e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229102539-g76e15e","updated":"20240229102907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"108、大柴胡汤出现的时候，病人一定兼有便秘同时兼有少阳证的现象；"}]},{"ID":"20240229102908-q9b0cz6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229102908-q9b0cz6","updated":"20240229104210"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"109、鸭肉能解硫磺毒；"}]},{"ID":"20240229104211-hp3p9cs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229104211-hp3p9cs","updated":"20240229151121"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"110、急下存阴，病人已经燥矢的很厉害，你不把它马上清出来的话，阳明证一直在那边，一直在热的话，里面津液会伤掉；"}]},{"ID":"20240307151913-81gng8f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240307151913-81gng8f","updated":"20240307151925"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"110.1、急下存阴的时候，不会用到调胃承气小承气。快下的时候用大承气；"}]},{"ID":"20240229112448-q4lpahy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229112448-q4lpahy","updated":"20240229141329"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"111、谵语：胡言乱语；"}]},{"ID":"20240229141329-6ymadua","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229141329-6ymadua","updated":"20240229151122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"112、桃核承气汤：治疗血症、淤血第一方；"}]},{"ID":"20240229151125-3ip4a8e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229151125-3ip4a8e","updated":"20240229151128"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"112.1、膀胱有淤血，就一个处方，桃核承气汤"}]},{"ID":"20240229142019-2yd6g3h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229142019-2yd6g3h","updated":"20240229150849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"113、桂枝这个药辛甘发散，它到心脏里面，能把心脏血喷射力量加强，攻淤的时候桃仁，有心脏动脉的血在后面推他，破淤的力量会更强。所以张仲景常常使用桂枝；"}]},{"ID":"20240229150846-rptlmct","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229150846-rptlmct","updated":"20240229150959"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"114、淤血不去，新血不生；"}]},{"ID":"20240229153847-yingk48","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229153847-yingk48","updated":"20240229153928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"115、喉咙是三阴之会，头部是六阳之会。如果“咽烂,”代表阴经已经伤到了，头冒汗，代表阳虚掉了，阴阳都虚掉了。"}]},{"ID":"20240229153931-fivcra3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229153931-fivcra3","updated":"20240229154321"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"116、手足都代表胃，摸他手脚都是热的，手脚背是冷的，代表胃气很足。"}]},{"ID":"20240229154322-kbdqzr6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229154322-kbdqzr6","updated":"20240229154458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"117、桂枝去芍药加蜀漆龙骨牡蛎救逆汤，是治疗烫伤第一方；"}]},{"ID":"20240229155355-98lgkz4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229155355-98lgkz4","updated":"20240229155403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"118、硫磺本身外用时非常的寒凉,外敷的时候是寒凉的。吃到身体里是燥热，极热的。西医就把硫磺跟膏药一起在烫伤的时候用；"}]},{"ID":"20240229155404-ovhg875","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229155404-ovhg875","updated":"20240229162310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"119、桂枝加桂汤，原文是桂枝汤加味桂枝二两，临床上加味肉桂会更有效；"}]},{"ID":"20240229162310-3prl78u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229162310-3prl78u","updated":"20240229162850"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"120、在病人出现烦躁的时候，张仲景都喜欢用茯苓。茯苓不单单是色白入肺，它入脾脏、利水。茯苓能够生津液。所以脐下悸我们用茯苓，因为茯苓能够把旧水排掉新水补回来。"}]},{"ID":"20240229162850-3tylly1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229162850-3tylly1","updated":"20240229163359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"121、喉咙痛、甲状腺：少商穴、商阳穴放血+针列缺照海；"}]},{"ID":"20240229163340-0tetifc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229163340-0tetifc","updated":"20240229173939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"122、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"中医消渴有三消：上消、中消、下消；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"上消渴饮百倍、中消胃口极大、下消性功能丧尸；"}]},{"ID":"20240229173427-ed3doub","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229173427-ed3doub","updated":"20240229174156"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"122.1、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"西医消渴也就是糖尿病有两种：一种是胰岛素依赖型"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；（1型，打了 B 肝疫苗，打下去胰脏就坏掉，属于西医制造出来的）、一种是吃宵夜，吃完马上睡觉（2型）；"}]},{"ID":"20240229171918-ke4glfz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229171918-ke4glfz","updated":"20240301084500"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"123、水蛭越细越小越好，虻虫越大越好；"}]},{"ID":"20240301084500-sy4ueb8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240301084500-sy4ueb8","updated":"20240301085554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"124、陈逊斋氏曰：盖少腹硬满,有「血结」,有「水结」,有「水血两结」。「血结」必见狂妄。小便是利的，病人发狂，用「抵当汤」。小便不利的，病人如狂，还没有真正的发狂，用「桃核承气汤证」。「水结」，如果水结下焦，必小便不利,「五苓散证」是也。「水血两结」必小便难,少腹满如墩状,如「大黄甘遂汤证」是也。"}]},{"ID":"20240229173757-v4mhoqq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229173757-v4mhoqq","updated":"20240301090537"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"125、开业中医开药要让自己赚钱，太便宜了反而得不到病人信任；"}]},{"ID":"20240301090516-ubzuss0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240301090516-ubzuss0","updated":"20240301095047"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"126、咖啡易造成胰脏癌，治疗胰脏癌时，咖啡先停掉；"}]},{"ID":"20240301095047-p73kz1e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240301095047-p73kz1e","updated":"20240301095353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"127、临床遇到久病、癌症都会有淤血。"}]},{"ID":"20240301095355-0aah2tc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240301095355-0aah2tc","updated":"20240301095404"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"128、附骨脉：你手摸他的脉，摸下去沉到骨边才摸到它，你按它越按跳的越快。附骨脉就是里面有阴实。"}]},{"ID":"20240301095405-tfxjcly","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240301095405-tfxjcly","updated":"20240301095548"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"129、抵挡汤急症用汤，缓征用丸；"}]},{"ID":"20240301095548-llhmijr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240301095548-llhmijr","updated":"20240304085333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"130、「藏结」，脏和腑本来是相通的，脏和腑中间有寒湿，寒湿像白痰，黏黏稠稠的梗在中间。脏结的成因是慢慢累积起来的，比如居于湿地，或汗每次没有透发，慢慢在关节累积起来，日积月累到里面去，这个寒湿慢慢就会停在脏腑中间，脏和腑分隔开来，就是藏结。"}]},{"ID":"20240301095539-r0g6gxg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240301095539-r0g6gxg","updated":"20240304085409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"131、「结胸」，一般误治才会有结胸。比如伤寒表症，是寒症，应该用麻黄汤去发表。结果攻下，一攻，皮肤表面表邪的水，应该发汗发掉的，跑到肺里面去，产生结胸。"}]},{"ID":"20240304085410-d446dr0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240304085410-d446dr0","updated":"20240304101331"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"132、肺是白色，心是赤色，肺比较多，心脏比较少，配在一起是粉红色。手掌是上焦的地方，所以常人手掌掌面是粉红色。如果肝有问题，长东西，肝有实症，硬化或长肿瘤。身上血回到心脏，肝脏里面已经有东西在里面了，容积变小了，这时很多的血回肝脏，一看已经有东西了，大量血进入心脏，红色加多，白色就变少了，手掌就开始红，肝病越来越严重，手掌慢慢变成暗红"}]},{"ID":"20240304101331-gzpbpea","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240304101331-gzpbpea","updated":"20240304102840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"133、结胸证有二，第一个，是热实结胸，第二个是寒实结胸；"}]},{"ID":"20240304103555-ogciks1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240304103555-ogciks1","updated":"20240304140138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"133.1、大陷胸汤用于热实结胸；三物小白散用于寒实结胸；还有一个十枣汤用于肺底下有积水导致的结胸证；"}]},{"ID":"20240304102841-hl59wbq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240304102841-hl59wbq","updated":"20240304114009"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"134、杏仁能制衡麻黄，所以杏仁与麻黄等量，麻黄开多点是没事的；"}]},{"ID":"20240304114009-5s3ldth","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240304114009-5s3ldth","updated":"20240304114312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"135、小陷胸汤症不按不痛，大陷胸汤证不按都痛；"}]},{"ID":"20240304114312-pqwyxir","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240304114312-pqwyxir","updated":"20240304114729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"136、栝蒌实能用来开结。什么结，有两个结，一个是痰造成的结，一个是气造成的结；"}]},{"ID":"20240304114729-pnl1h29","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240304114729-pnl1h29","updated":"20240304140746"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"137、巴豆后遗症——下痢不止；喝一杯冷水可解；也可通过吃黄连或者喝豆浆解；"}]},{"ID":"20240304115015-aotjtfk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240304115015-aotjtfk","updated":"20240304141448"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"138、巴豆六用：皆是寒症；"}]},{"ID":"20240304141228-z7w0vlm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240304141228-z7w0vlm","updated":"20240304141435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（1）"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"巴豆、桔梗等量同用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：用在肺上面的脓疡，很深排不出来的情况；"}]},{"ID":"20240304141231-8pjgmgk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240304141231-8pjgmgk","updated":"20240304141534"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（2）"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"巴豆和贝母同用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：去喉咙、咽喉之堵塞，吞不下东西，通关利节；"}]},{"ID":"20240304141249-oaj6jsi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240304141249-oaj6jsi","updated":"20240304141842"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（3）"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"巴豆、杏仁同用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：[走马汤]，用在心胸的结毒,胶痰或坏死食物堵在胸口，拒按，胸口痛，吃则吐，大便排不出的情况；"}]},{"ID":"20240304141259-l3g796z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240304141259-l3g796z","updated":"20240304142230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（4）"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"巴豆和大黄、干姜并用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：用在下腹结痛,肚子结痛；可能是大肠癌，或者是肿瘤，大便排不出来；"}]},{"ID":"20240304141307-9ro0s97","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240304141307-9ro0s97","updated":"20240304142423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（5）"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"巴豆和炮附子、吴茱萸同用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：专门治心胸寒痛,胃里面感觉冰凉；"}]},{"ID":"20240304141315-c3bui0q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240304141315-c3bui0q","updated":"20240304142435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（6）"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"巴豆与芫花同用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：去大腹积水与痞块积聚；"}]},{"ID":"20240304142153-zvb95sx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240304142153-zvb95sx","updated":"20240304142158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"138.1、用到巴豆,必须病人没有被西医处理过。"}]},{"ID":"20240304140843-anhqijz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240304140843-anhqijz","updated":"20240304150920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"139、女人如果是伤寒，月经来的时候，不用吃药自己会好。只有中风的时候，就是桂枝汤症，才会需要。"}]},{"ID":"20240304150921-0z6f5vg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240304150921-0z6f5vg","updated":"20240304165747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"140、最好的柴胡是一半在土里面，一半长在外面；"}]},{"ID":"20240304165747-dzip3av","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240304165747-dzip3av","updated":"20240304171837"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"141、痨症：痨症的人一定很瘦，他比平常我们正常的血管粗，怎么吃都吃不胖，他的血管一半跟正常的血管容积是相等的，也就是比正常人大两倍，另一半是湿。所以这个风湿跑到血脉里面去了，称为痨。就是因为这个风湿在血脉里，结果你开去风湿的药去不掉，因为风湿的药去关节的。"}]},{"ID":"20240304171847-nffm7bl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240304171847-nffm7bl","updated":"20240304171859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"141.1、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"除痨的第一方就是柴胡桂枝干姜汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20240304171852-v1q7o2h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240304171852-v1q7o2h","updated":"20240304172855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"142、干姜温中，生姜散水；"}]},{"ID":"20240304172855-7xuvfxk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240304172855-7xuvfxk","updated":"20240304174955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"143、如果阳跑到四肢上，外证，大部分我们统统用到牡蛎把阳收回来；如果说阳在外，还有心阳也外走，肾阳也外走的时候，就要加龙骨下去了；"}]},{"ID":"20240304174224-o3mmtmm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240304174224-o3mmtmm","updated":"20240305082737"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"144、表里证都有的时候还是会摸到沉细的脉。千万不要摸到是沉细的脉判断是纯阴症；"}]},{"ID":"20240305082737-0o8gpec","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305082737-0o8gpec","updated":"20240305085557"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"145、大陷胸汤症跟大陷胸丸症病症有差异："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"大陷胸汤剂"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"的时候，结胸的症状在心下鞭硬有两种，一种是心蔽骨正中间下非常强硬痛，第二个是从心下一直痛到关元，这个痛是往下直着走的，大陷胸汤症"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"大陷胸丸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"不是，大陷胸丸心下痞，但它是往上走的，痛一直往上升，大陷胸丸。因为往上升，所以我们用丸剂慢慢吞下去，用汤剂走太快了，还来不及走"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"；"}]},{"ID":"20240305090052-06k8ead","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305090052-06k8ead","updated":"20240305090121"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"145.1、结胸，鞭满而痛，痛往上走大陷胸丸，痛往下走，大陷胸汤。满而不痛，心下痞；"}]},{"ID":"20240305084500-gc8ggsh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305084500-gc8ggsh","updated":"20240305085619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"146、痞证跟结胸症也是不同的；结胸拒按，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"鞭痛而痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"此为陷胸汤证；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"满而不痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"此为痞，泻心汤证；"}]},{"ID":"20240305085833-7002gij","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305085833-7002gij","updated":"20240305085856"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"146.1、痞症跟结胸证，都是因为伤寒被误下导致的。"}]},{"ID":"20240305085938-gver7n8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305085938-gver7n8","updated":"20240305085955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"146.2、痞症一般出现在平常肠胃就不好的人。表病，还没有治，被攻下了。表邪下陷造成心下痞。肠胃很好的人反而不会有心下痞。"}]},{"ID":"20240305084520-m3yydg9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305084520-m3yydg9","updated":"20240305090513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"147、在治疗肠胃的时候用生甘草，不用炙甘草。当发现病人有寒的时候，才会用到炙甘草；"}]},{"ID":"20240305090606-2jmxz6k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305090606-2jmxz6k","updated":"20240305092114"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"148、甘草有蓄水的功能，所以配伍排水的药时，不用甘草；"}]},{"ID":"20240305092115-zwrrts4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305092115-zwrrts4","updated":"20240305094339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"149、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"十枣汤又名朱雀汤，因为以红枣为主"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20240305103942-vrxxl3l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305103942-vrxxl3l","updated":"20240305103947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"149.1、十枣汤上吐下泻以后，不要马上吃，差不多要发三个小时上吐下泻。上吐下泻完以后，病人的胃缓，代表药力已经过去了，这个时候要喝稀饭或面煮的比较烂，不要放调味料，油的东西，可以放一点点海盐；"}]},{"ID":"20240305094330-63ial3h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305094330-63ial3h","updated":"20240305103641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"150、甘遂这个药去水，力量非常的强，去肺，还有子宫，里面的水，肺周围的水；如果是三焦系统里面有积水，这个时候用大戟；芫花也是去水，去腹部、胸部积水；"}]},{"ID":"20240305103628-62jsca1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305103628-62jsca1","updated":"20240305104808"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"151、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"在读伤寒论的时候，你看到心就把它当做胃。心下就是胃下，看到胃就当成肠。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240305104805-gcp9yk3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305104805-gcp9yk3","updated":"20240305115940"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"152、胃实热虚热差异：实热如胃口大，渴饮百杯；虚热如胃发炎、脸冒痘、流鼻血等..."}]},{"ID":"20240305115940-961kcr4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305115940-961kcr4","updated":"20240305140632"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"153、痞症汤方：大黄黄连泻心汤、附子泻心汤、五苓散、生姜泻心汤、甘草泻心汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240305135526-ecm5pzt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305135526-ecm5pzt","updated":"20240305142554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"154、先便后血，外痔；先血后便，内痔；血便混合，肠炎；"}]},{"ID":"20240305142554-b1stwsz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305142554-b1stwsz","updated":"20240305144143"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"155、萎症（肌肉萎缩掉）：持续在虚症的状态下，你没有好好调理治好他，到后来病人会筋脉动悸，津液伤到筋脉，这个时候久而成痿。"}]},{"ID":"20240305143618-kn9m8sv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305143618-kn9m8sv","updated":"20240305143709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"155.1、内经说萎症独取阳明；阳明代表消化系统，如果把消化系统弄好了，就可以治疗萎症；"}]},{"ID":"20240305144128-vmjunir","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305144128-vmjunir","updated":"20240305145025"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"156、现代人得到胃酸就是甜食吃太多了，现在人工糖造成胃酸；治好病人，要告诉他甜食不能吃。真正的天然的糖做成的甜食可以吃；"}]},{"ID":"20240305144957-f2lqakb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305144957-f2lqakb","updated":"20240305150304"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"157、人参较贵，如病人条件艰苦，可考虑换成党参；"}]},{"ID":"20240305150304-3pbfv3l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305150304-3pbfv3l","updated":"20240305151755"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"158、越甜的瓜，瓜蒂越苦；"}]},{"ID":"20240305151755-9exyqvf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305151755-9exyqvf","updated":"20240305152645"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"159、临床上很多病，根本没有用到吐剂，但病人是吐了而解掉的，所以吐是一种身体自救解病的方式。"}]},{"ID":"20240305152634-wiwtk2c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305152634-wiwtk2c","updated":"20240305152732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"159.1、曾经有一个病人打电话跟我说有肾结石。肾结石，中医的判断方法可以在太溪穴到复溜穴这一段，这一段有压痛点，就是有结石结到，一般的处方有猪苓汤，西医的方法呢就是病人验尿，试纸咖啡色就代表有结石，他过来我给他扎针，扎针的时候，痛已经去掉，病人能感觉到结石在移动，然后开汤药给他，猪苓汤，第二天他又打电话来说他好了，我说他怎么知道自己好了，他说试纸变成蓝色正常了，痛也没有了，小便看到有石头排出来。可是呢，他说头天晚上吃完药很不好过。他吃完药吐，一吐完小便就跟着下来了。\n那你开猪苓汤的时候，想的他根本就不是吐剂。吐解有两种，一种是真正是服药去吐它。还有一种是因为他是肾结石，上面有痰梗到，所以尿才会在肾里面一直累积起来，排不出去，尿垢慢慢累积起来变成结石。要是吃一些钙片，结石出现的更快。"}]},{"ID":"20240305152737-gxjd47x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305152737-gxjd47x","updated":"20240305155351"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"160、渴饮百杯不能止渴，饥食百碗不能解饥：白虎汤（血糖低导致饿，流冷汗，发抖症状也可用）；"}]},{"ID":"20240305155022-wk3nyzp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305155022-wk3nyzp","updated":"20240305160339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"161、张仲景在有胸满的症状的时候，一定会加重枳实，有腹痛的时候，一定会重用芍药。如果弄错了，有胸满的时候，重用芍药，他会更满，胸会更胀。所以治疗心脏病几乎不用到白芍，胸满气喘用不到白芍。治疗肚子痛的时候，用不到枳实，但是在胸满的时候，一定会用到枳实。"}]},{"ID":"20240305160340-dxzz5h7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305160340-dxzz5h7","updated":"20240305160619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"162、胃里面发炎张仲景会用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"大黄黄连"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，如果到了肠子发炎会用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄芩"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，如果肠胃都发炎，大黄、黄连、黄芩"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"三黄汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20240305160619-9xik0gk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305160619-9xik0gk","updated":"20240305161752"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"163、以胃做标准，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"胃有发炎的话，我们经方开的是黄连"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，在胃之上还有热的话就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"大黄"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（上焦），胃之下小肠里的话就会用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄芩"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（下焦）。寒凉的药能够去热，以现代医学讲的话，就是消炎。黄连能够去胸腔和胃热的毒，黄芩去小肠发炎的毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240305161637-sogrra0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305161637-sogrra0","updated":"20240305172827"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"164、促脉为阳脉，不会致命，结脉或代脉为阴脉，摸到代表心脏有问题了。"}]},{"ID":"20240305172654-6y0mhl5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305172654-6y0mhl5","updated":"20240305172819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"164.1、结脉好像绳结一样，一个结一个结，你把一条绳子打了很多结，你拉绳子感觉到的，那就是结脉。代脉就是跳起来以后，停掉了，停掉以后回来的力量很慢，好像很挣扎脉才回来，这就是代脉。这是结脉跟代脉不太一样。但是两个都是属于阴。遇到这种阴受伤的时候，代表心脏有问题；"}]},{"ID":"20240305172828-cqbb9hz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305172828-cqbb9hz","updated":"20240305173122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"165、小建中汤补阳，炙甘草汤补阴；"}]},{"ID":"20240305173232-9k51bil","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305173232-9k51bil","updated":"20240305173302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"165.1、张仲景很少用补药的，伤寒论中只有小建中汤和炙甘草汤这两个滋补的方剂；"}]},{"ID":"20240305173122-dc0u6sr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305173122-dc0u6sr","updated":"20240305174211"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"166、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"津液"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"津"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"就是肌肉腠理里面的水分，汗水滚滚出来，叫做津。流汗出来，身体上是杂调他的津，津不足的时候是人参，人参补津液。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"液"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"定义是什么？灵枢里面决气篇，说谷气，五谷杂粮吃到肠胃里面去，就会产生营养，这个营养再注入骨节，骨髓里面去。到骨节里面，骨节可以伸曲，注入骨髓能够补益脑髓，皮肤的润泽，头脑的智慧，骨节的伸曲，是液。"}]},{"ID":"20240305174216-gmgc2wn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305174216-gmgc2wn","updated":"20240305174221"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"166.1、津和液一个是阳，一个是阴。"}]},{"ID":"20240305174203-aq6k8aq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305174203-aq6k8aq","updated":"20240305174326"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"167、阿胶除了补血还有止血的功能；"}]},{"ID":"20240305174327-my4inw6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305174327-my4inw6","updated":"20240305175310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"168、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"心脏有问题的症状"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240305174920-0rzkzwr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305174920-0rzkzwr","updated":"20240305174945"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第一个症状就是失眠，睡不好。吃了炙甘草汤，睡着代表对症，吃了一天两天还不能睡觉，那你处方要换掉了，经方是一剂就知道。"}]},{"ID":"20240305174937-8vvfq46","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305174937-8vvfq46","updated":"20240305174946"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第二个，大便。心脏和小肠是表里。当心脏功能不好的时候，大便一定不规则。常常便秘或下痢。大便正常了，代表心脏好了。"}]},{"ID":"20240305174939-xmmrz78","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305174939-xmmrz78","updated":"20240305174947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第三，手脚温热，心脏有问题手足冰冷。"}]},{"ID":"20240305174943-ckozbj3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305174943-ckozbj3","updated":"20240305174947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第四，无胸痛。心脏有问题，很多人会兼到有胸痛气闷的现象。这个都是心脏出现问题了。如果你有失眠，大小便不规则，手脚是冰冷的，胸又痛，你去医院检测的时候，搞不好在机器下面你还是正常，因为那个机器一定是等你发心脏病的时候，才知道你是生病了。"}]},{"ID":"20240305174953-35501dq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305174953-35501dq","updated":"20240306084702"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"169、衣食住行四项，可以穿好的衣服，住好的房子，开好的车，但吃一定要简单，生病的时候五分饱，让刺激你的胃气，你不要吃太饱，平常吃七八分饱，不要吃十分饱；"}]},{"ID":"20240306084646-r2r0chx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240306084646-r2r0chx","updated":"20240306094701"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"170、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"头痛有三"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：阙上痛或头顶即正头顶百会穴位置痛，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"阳明头痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；如果是两侧，偏头痛，就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"少阳头痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"。如果是后头痛，就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"太阳头痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20240306094636-1qum2cu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240306094636-1qum2cu","updated":"20240306094643"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"170.1、阙上痛就是两眉之间的印堂痛；"}]},{"ID":"20240306085550-vw65em2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240306085550-vw65em2","updated":"20240306085947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"171、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"阳明病无所复传"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，因为万物所归，因为脾土肠胃的功能非常的强大，它能够消化任何东西，就像大自然界的土一样，能够承载万物。"}]},{"ID":"20240306085950-wxptqrx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240306085950-wxptqrx","updated":"20240306094405"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"172、水的汽化是靠胃，谷的消化是靠脾"}]},{"ID":"20240306094405-064l60y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240306094405-064l60y","updated":"20240306094923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"173、胃气分清浊，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"清气上升"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，到胃的气街。胃在消化的时候，清气上升的时候，从胃到头这一段，称为气街。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"浊气下降"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"到足三里（合穴）的地方。为什么要知道这个，当你的胃病，是吃东西吃坏肚子，得到的肠胃病，你得到的是浊气。浊气不会往上走，它是往下走，走到足三里。所以你吃坏肚子，扎足三里肚子很舒服，原因就在这里面。"}]},{"ID":"20240306095106-yon2h7o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240306095106-yon2h7o","updated":"20240306095118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"173.1、清气上升不会头痛，浊气上升才会头痛；"}]},{"ID":"20240306095118-byt2orf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240306095118-byt2orf","updated":"20240306103340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"174、唐容川讲，只要是口渴，不欲饮水，他是有淤血；"}]},{"ID":"20240306103340-a7ya2oc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240306103340-a7ya2oc","updated":"20240306112241"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"175、当归赤豆散，赤小豆一定要用发芽的；"}]},{"ID":"20240306112402-yaokcht","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240306112402-yaokcht","updated":"20240306112620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"175.1、为什么赤小豆要用发芽的，取他的药性，盲肠炎破裂以后变成腹膜炎，赤小豆发芽后一根一根可以钻到很深的地方去；"}]},{"ID":"20240307160751-dhb4rmk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240307160751-dhb4rmk","updated":"20240307160802"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"175.2、赤小豆去湿，大部分是化脓的湿；"}]},{"ID":"20240306112141-oidmtab","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240306112141-oidmtab","updated":"20240306115358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"176、实症是持续的痛，虚症是隐隐约约一阵一阵的痛；"}]},{"ID":"20240306112818-ta8wcbu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240306112818-ta8wcbu","updated":"20240306141617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"177、夫实则谵语，虚则郑声，郑声，重语也；"}]},{"ID":"20240306141617-gq03css","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240306141617-gq03css","updated":"20240306141935"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"178、孤阴不生，独阳不长。正常人上面是阴，下面是阳，地天泰卦。阳绝的时候，阳就没有办法把阴固住，皮肤固表，就是阳。阳没有了阴就往下走了。控制不住了，下痢则死。如果有人上吊，大小便还没出来，代表人还有救，如果大小便出来就完了。下痢则死，因为阳绝了。"}]},{"ID":"20240306141938-yg65mpc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240306141938-yg65mpc","updated":"20240306153221"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"179、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"如果遇到结石的时候，在脚的内踝落，太溪穴到复溜穴会找到结石的压痛点，如果懂针灸，用手压到痛点，针扎到痛点的时候，痛就去掉，病人会感觉石头在动，一直在移动。再煮猪苓汤再攻，有时候用药丸丸剂也可以。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240306153216-4ui3x5s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240306153216-4ui3x5s","updated":"20240306162526"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"180、三阴骨：一个是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"泥丸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，就是囱骨小孩子两三岁这个骨头开始收、第二个就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"耳后高骨"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"。第三个就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"膝盖骨"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20240306162527-n6k98pt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240306162527-n6k98pt","updated":"20240306163117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"180.1、文字稿：过去，我们知道有这个东西，没有很肯定，后来黄帝外经出来就看到了里面写的骨三阴。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"临床上怎么解释？如果光看这个不知道它是做什么"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，曾经治疗血癌的时候，小朋友做化疗骨髓移植，结果做完西医宣布无治了。无治以后来找我了，给他吃中药，两个礼拜之后，小孩子胃口也开了，元气也恢复了，再回去一查，没有血癌。没有血癌的时候，西医说是他骨髓换的有效，你已经换了半年前了，做了化疗没效到我手上来的，病人快死了。结果病人家属倾向西医，又找西医治疗，到十一月的时候，有一天突然小朋友，耳朵后面高骨，肿起来一大块，这是骨三阴，代表病进入阴了，这很危险的症状。耳前后肿，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"小孩子受惊吓的时候，耳朵后面有鸡爪的血脉，刺刺放点血，受惊的时候可以用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240306162524-bnwzan0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240306162524-bnwzan0","updated":"20240306170505"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"骨三阴如果出现实症的时候，代表阴实，为什么会造成阴实？我一再告诉他爸爸，感冒的时候一定要吃中药，绝对不可以吃抗生素，结果小孩子感冒，吃两个礼拜抗生素，吃完以后骨头就肿起来了。阴骨肿起来，病到阴实。病到阴实的时候小孩子很聪明啊，跟爸爸说我们吃倪医师的药就好，因为治好过一次啊，西医坚持不让治疗，说要再做化疗。结果他的爸爸在那模凌两可，我就跟他讲一句话，我讲这句话的目的是要救他儿子，我说这一次一定要西医写下契结书，白纸黑字写好，说我们西医没效，我再帮你动手，否则我不治疗；因为他也不会听你的话，对不对？西医治死了他不会怪西医，只会怪中医，结果呢，小朋友就死在了医院里。这病历都在我手上，本来可以不用死的。"}]},{"ID":"20240306153215-923m7sx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240306153215-923m7sx","updated":"20240306172603"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"181、治肝先实脾；"}]},{"ID":"20240306172603-epnz41j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240306172603-epnz41j","updated":"20240306183839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"182、肝腹水、肾脏水肿对治：详见文字稿第二百四十七条。"}]},{"ID":"20240306183751-8ca2tde","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240306183751-8ca2tde","updated":"20240306190134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"183、倪师临床经验：半夜一点到三点醒来，两年会看到肝癌；"}]},{"ID":"20240306190207-8axz4px","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240306190207-8axz4px","updated":"20240306190326"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"183.1、肝癌初期第一个症状就是半夜一到三点醒；第二个症状是脸色气色暗，眼睛周围发青；"}]},{"ID":"20240306190101-7hnkphk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240306190101-7hnkphk","updated":"20240307090428"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"184、上气不足，下气过实，其人善忘；"}]},{"ID":"20240307092353-1qz9wo9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240307092353-1qz9wo9","updated":"20240307092425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"185、倪师临床百分之八十癌症都跟便秘有关系，所以宁可下痢，也不要便秘；"}]},{"ID":"20240307092426-e5ulmsy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240307092426-e5ulmsy","updated":"20240307112521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"186、承气汤是用于热而实，麻仁丸是用于燥而实；"}]},{"ID":"20240307112522-pkdmbv7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240307112522-pkdmbv7","updated":"20240307114258"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"187、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"脾约"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：思伤脾。脾脏管湿，但是脾喜燥恶湿，不喜欢湿。当湿完全没有也不行，思念太过的时候会越来越焦躁。小肠里面的津液来自脾脏，脾在内经主少腹，腹部讲的是小肠，小肠水分不够，为什么会不够，就是思，思伤脾，这个是情志引起的。当脾没法提供津液的时候，小肠会干掉。小肠干掉的时候，出现的症状是大便难，这个症状是脾约。"}]},{"ID":"20240307114303-6bc6ue9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240307114303-6bc6ue9","updated":"20240307114350"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"187.1、脾约：大便像羊大便一样一颗一颗，堵到小肠里面。小肠因为褶皱很多，大便堵到弯道的地方，排出来一颗一颗的，而且非常的干。"}]},{"ID":"20240307114415-d9xvl1o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240307114415-d9xvl1o","updated":"20240307114436"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"187.2、常发生于女生身上，女生思虑较重；"}]},{"ID":"20240307114009-xtpr1ww","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240307114009-xtpr1ww","updated":"20240307150917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"188、去湿的方法就是利小便；除非湿在关节的时候，用汗解来去湿，否则的话都是利小便。"}]},{"ID":"20240307150855-mmu4p1l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240307150855-mmu4p1l","updated":"20240308150622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"189、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"下法分两个，一个是攻大便，一个是攻小便。阳症时通利大便。阴证时通利小便。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240307151045-bvlfz14","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240307151045-bvlfz14","updated":"20240307151213"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"189.1、所以不管是实脾饮，分消汤，或者是补气建中汤，都是去利湿，利小便出来，所以在阴证一般都会去利小便，很少去利大便。"}]},{"ID":"20240307151319-7iimzps","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240307151319-7iimzps","updated":"20240307151325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"189.2、利小便的力量没有利大便那么好，所以能够把病阻止在阳明证的时候，通大便的药会比利小便的药来的快，几乎无所不通。小便就不见的利出来了，因为他是阴证。"}]},{"ID":"20240307151119-ojspq8f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240307151119-ojspq8f","updated":"20240307160027"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"190、在伤寒里面一共三个方子，治疗"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"全身发黄发高热者"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"1、无汗，病人没有汗的时候，用麻黄连翘赤小豆汤。\n2、病人有汗且实热在里，就是茵陈蒿汤。\n3、无表证无里实而身发黄，栀子蘗皮汤。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240307155625-bdisnwv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240307155625-bdisnwv","updated":"20240307162837"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"191、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"少阳"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：介于半表半里，所有介于肌肉中间的油网，脏腑中间的网络，奇桓之腑统统属于少阳，少阳是全身上下无所不到。少阳证会延伸出太阴症、少阴症、厥阴证。"}]},{"ID":"20240307162837-bpzihga","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240307162837-bpzihga","updated":"20240307163038"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"192、在三阳症，太阳阳明少阳，这是无死症。如果失治才会进入阴症，这个才会出现死症。反过来，如果病人是少阴症，治疗一段时间之后变成少阳了，都是病要出表了，是好的现象。"}]},{"ID":"20240307162840-mg9ocm3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240307162840-mg9ocm3","updated":"20240307163711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"193、乳癌处方：处方怎么来？第一个她是在少阳所以用柴胡汤做加减，第二个看他经络，乳头正下方是肝经，所以加的有疏肝的药，还有肾经经过，所以加一些肾经的药，咸味入肾，软坚。心包经也经过，胃经也经过，经过乳房的经络都开在里面，让经络顺畅，淤积的东西去掉，当然不会有乳癌，硬块就去掉了。"}]},{"ID":"20240307163721-0keffg5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240307163721-0keffg5","updated":"20240307164819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"194、西医止痛药有造成肝癌风险；"}]},{"ID":"20240307164820-kx1a9vz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240307164820-kx1a9vz","updated":"20240307170446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"195、肝开窍在眼，脾开窍在唇，心开窍在舌，肺窍在鼻，肾开窍在耳。之所以能开窍在五官，是因为有少阳连贯到；"}]},{"ID":"20240307170428-qgs4wmu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240307170428-qgs4wmu","updated":"20240308091138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"196、皮肤腠理出的汗就是津，津很足的时候，新的津不断去换旧的津，所以流汗是一个调津的动作，所以人一定要流汗；"}]},{"ID":"20240308091138-8dqzuiu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240308091138-8dqzuiu","updated":"20240308092943"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"197、人有精、气、津、液、血、脉，精脱则耳聋。液脱则耳鸣。"}]},{"ID":"20240308092944-bbto13z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240308092944-bbto13z","updated":"20240308105448"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"198、毁坏一样东西很容易，但修复一样东西是很困难的，中医就是修理车子，西医就是用榔头帮车子打坏掉。所以因为西医和许多营养剂介入，现代治起病来需要的时间周期会变长许多。"}]},{"ID":"20240308154454-z542s7f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240308154454-z542s7f","updated":"20240308155119"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"199、三阴病五脏所属；太阴→少阴→厥阴。"}]},{"ID":"20240308154523-i9tpmzr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240308154523-i9tpmzr","updated":"20240311125431"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 376px;","style":"width: 366px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240308154457-moyi3ss.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 366px;\" parent-style=\"width: 376px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240311125352-wr40stf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240311125352-wr40stf","updated":"20240311125655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"199.1、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"太阴为肺与脾；少阴为肾与心；厥阴为肝与心包，胆就靠心包来推动它，才能排胆汁；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240311125618-8gvhttx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240311125618-8gvhttx","updated":"20240311125622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"199.2、太阴没好，影响到少阴，少阴再没好，阴寒会进入厥阴，"}]},{"ID":"20240311125634-z3i9xdp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240311125634-z3i9xdp","updated":"20240311125645"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"199.3、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"从太阴到少阴看到的都是阴症，等到厥阴的时候，就寒热并见。寒多热少就完蛋了，热多寒少就有救。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240308105438-pp1mo14","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240308105438-pp1mo14","updated":"20240308154507"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"200、太阴是阴之初。少阴是阴之中。厥阴是阴之尽；"}]},{"ID":"20240308113628-sig5kaw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240308113628-sig5kaw","updated":"20240308154508"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"201、太阴只有两个处方；"}]},{"ID":"20240308114051-ou5zzg6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240308114051-ou5zzg6","updated":"20240308154509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"202、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"脾脏在管饿不饿，胰脏在管吃东西有没有味道"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240308114456-idzzpwa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240308114456-idzzpwa","updated":"20240308154511"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"202.1、如没胃口，脾脏有问题，吃东西没有味道，如同嚼蜡，胰脏有问题。"}]},{"ID":"20240308114519-x0gtf6c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240308114519-x0gtf6c","updated":"20240308154512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"203、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"太阴病主症：腹满，吐，吃不下，四肢烦疼。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240308114708-4athdia","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240308114708-4athdia","updated":"20240308154513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"204、用炮附子生姜的时候，是去水，去积，水积"}]},{"ID":"20240308150025-2xgms5h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240308150025-2xgms5h","updated":"20240308154514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"205、文字稿：张仲景实在很讨厌（笑），有时候用生附子用的干姜。有的时候用炮附子用的生姜。有的时候干姜生姜一起用。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"张仲景生附子炮附子不会用在一起，我呢生附子炮附子还会用在一起"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"。因为我知道张仲景在想什么，我告诉诸位张仲景在想什么。我不是跟同学们讲过吗，胎胪药录张仲景读的那本药典不见了，他会这样子开处方...经方呢，是张仲景之前就有的东西，不是张仲景发明的，但是经方的药性用法一定是根据胎胪药录来的。"}]},{"ID":"20240308150050-5iyd8r7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240308150050-5iyd8r7","updated":"20240308150059"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"当你"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"用炮附子生姜的时候，是去水，去积，水积"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"。生附子和干姜。干姜温中，生附子因为非常迅捷，全身的血脉神经都会用到，所以我们在救逆的时候，如果这个人有水用炮附子生姜。如果这个人心脏不行了，里寒了，里面虚掉了，我们用炮附子干姜。胃口都没了干姜重用上去，生附子一整颗下去。"}]},{"ID":"20240308150050-px6pgb5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240308150050-px6pgb5","updated":"20240308150100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"什么时候生附子和炮附子会用到一起，水很大的时候"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，炮附子和生姜只能有一定的能力，但是这个水侵犯到心脏的时候，心脏的水太多了，心脏本来是火，水太多了，火要熄灭掉了。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"心脏快不行的时候，生附子和炮附子用在一起。水排出来速度很快"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240308150101-asw4qwb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240308150101-asw4qwb","updated":"20240308154518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"206、小孩子得到血癌就是打小儿麻痹疫苗，小儿麻痹疫苗的后遗症，一个是脑瘤，一个是血癌；"}]},{"ID":"20240308151409-934ueoy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240308151409-934ueoy","updated":"20240308154703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"206.1、血癌是太阴症，桂枝加芍药汤临床常用于治疗太阴证，根据病人状态进行加味。"}]},{"ID":"20240308151839-0zmoa28","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240308151839-0zmoa28","updated":"20240308154806"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"207、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"心是火，肾是水，在血脉系统里是连到，所以用生附子会从肾脏一路跑到心脏去。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240308154735-ac4ilr8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240308154735-ac4ilr8","updated":"20240308155031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"208、脾统血，心生血，肝藏血，这三个脏有问题都会影响到造血系统。人会贫血的意思。"}]},{"ID":"20240308155032-t1wkdtf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240308155032-t1wkdtf","updated":"20240308162705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"209、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"少阴病主症：脉微细，但欲寐；脉是越来越微细，常常倦怠想睡觉；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"咽痛，吐、利；"}]},{"ID":"20240308155341-rj6662t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240308155341-rj6662t","updated":"20240308162839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"210、少阴症出现的时候，因为是里寒湿，绝对不要用汗法，发汗病人只会更虚；强发汗，病人心脏会受不了；"}]},{"ID":"20240308162808-rbjakrd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240308162808-rbjakrd","updated":"20240308165853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"211、小孩子纯阳之体，手脚很热，被子盖肚子上就好了；"}]},{"ID":"20240308165853-67o03ra","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240308165853-67o03ra","updated":"20240308170816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"212、一般少阴症太阴症，利尿比较好。因为寒湿在中膈的时候，利尿是最短最近的路。"}]},{"ID":"20240308170817-96y83au","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240308170817-96y83au","updated":"20240308171655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"213、一般来说只要进入阴症，造血功能就不行了；"}]},{"ID":"20240308171656-4mtm8o7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240308171656-4mtm8o7","updated":"20240311085433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"214、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"心藏神"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，肝藏魂，肺藏魄。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"心中永远有一滴血停在里面，神就藏在那一滴血里面"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，新的血取代旧的血，心脏里面永远有一滴血在中间。少阴症很重的时候，血会伤到，这滴血会没有，当这滴血失去之后，心藏神，神就没有办法藏在心里面了，神就往外游，会失眠。黄连阿胶汤的阿胶能够补血，阿胶补血怎么那么凑巧补到心脏？这是因为加了鸡蛋黄，中药是取药性，我们要让阿胶悬浮在正中间，正好就像心脏那一滴血一样，找遍食物所有东西，只有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"鸡蛋黄永远是浮在中间"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，所以要用鸡蛋黄的性，把它导到里面去。这才是真正黄连阿胶汤的意思。生蛋黄下去，阿胶下去，苦味的药入心，苦味药把阿胶带到心脏中心，停到那就要靠蛋黄，蛋黄让这些药到此为止，专补心脏。所以这个药吃下去，就补那一滴血。不用鸡蛋黄不行。不加蛋黄药吃下去不能睡，蛋黄一下去就能睡。"}]},{"ID":"20240311085255-th4z7dv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240311085255-th4z7dv","updated":"20240311091936"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"215、病人脉阴阳俱紧，反汗出者，亡阳也；此属「少阴」，法当咽痛，而复吐、利。"}]},{"ID":"20240311091937-orxgkdf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240311091937-orxgkdf","updated":"20240311095535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"215.1、少阴病就是寒湿挡在心肾中间，让心和肾没有办法相交，心的火回逆往上走造成咽痛，肾的寒水往下走，造成下痢。"}]},{"ID":"20240311092102-mk5clom","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240311092102-mk5clom","updated":"20240311092227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"216、少阴病只要是没有口渴，津液没有问题，可以用灸的方式把寒湿去掉。怎么知道灸哪里？寒湿在哪里哪里就冷。"}]},{"ID":"20240311092228-ve2bv69","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240311092228-ve2bv69","updated":"20240311092515"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"217、少阴症只可以利尿，不可以发表"}]},{"ID":"20240311092515-ap7na5b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240311092515-ap7na5b","updated":"20240311094525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"218、经方里，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"生姜"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"也可以止呕，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"半夏"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"也可以止呕，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"干姜"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"也可以止呕，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"吴茱萸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"也可以止呕；"}]},{"ID":"20240311094749-o6vgrtt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240311094749-o6vgrtt","updated":"20240311094753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"218.1、手脚温度体现胃气的强弱，吐的厉害的时候，手足冰冷，用吴茱萸来治。"}]},{"ID":"20240311094517-o4430me","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240311094517-o4430me","updated":"20240311100211"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"219、补能恋邪，当有病邪在身上的时候，如果吃到补药，就像打狗又给它骨头吃，它不会走；"}]},{"ID":"20240311100212-sv9no65","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240311100212-sv9no65","updated":"20240311103515"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"220、半夏苦酒汤不要泡白醋泡黑醋力量比较强。"}]},{"ID":"20240311100208-ex0fzv4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240311100208-ex0fzv4","updated":"20240311113729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"221、葱白，常用于上下通利能通表里；"}]},{"ID":"20240311113741-i1pslmm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240311113741-i1pslmm","updated":"20240311113821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"221.1、葱跟大蒜不一样，大蒜是色白入肺，葱像根管子一样，同时像人的毛孔。"}]},{"ID":"20240311104340-vr7maek","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240311104340-vr7maek","updated":"20240311105320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"222、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"原汤化原食"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：如山东人吃水饺喝汤，单纯吃水饺没法消化，喝了水饺汤后就能消化；如鱼骨头卡在喉咙里，取同一条鱼的一根骨头，火烧焦黑，打碎变成灰，当药粉水冲下去，一阳一阴，一结合骨头就会掉下去，化掉了；"}]},{"ID":"20240311105308-wcp7hv2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240311105308-wcp7hv2","updated":"20240311105505"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"223、文字稿：我的老师，他的腰闪到，自己没有把法扎针，他找童子，弄一泡尿回来，喝下去大概二十分钟，他感觉腰的活力很强，腰的命门的地方一直在动，痛开始慢慢舒缓下来，热力慢慢扩散开来，就好了。他说"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"童子尿很强，进到命门的地方，童子是纯阳的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240311105910-12vzqfv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240311105910-12vzqfv","updated":"20240311105920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"224、脉症不合是危险的症状。"}]},{"ID":"20240311105921-e3z8pvq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240311105921-e3z8pvq","updated":"20240311110826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"225、伤寒论只要出现“或”，就是讲有时候有这个症状，有时候没有这个症状。"}]},{"ID":"20240311110827-pf0u6sp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240311110827-pf0u6sp","updated":"20240311112534"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"226、通脉四逆汤与四逆汤药味一样，但用量略有差异，通脉四逆汤的干姜减一半，就是四逆汤；通脉四逆汤症与四逆汤症相比，通脉四逆汤症的中焦更寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240311113136-5o61nhx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240311113136-5o61nhx","updated":"20240311113207"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"227、动脉剥离\\动脉破裂"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"有两种情况：一种"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"是里面堵塞掉了导致的破裂；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"一种"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"是血管破裂掉了，如果是淤血跑回心脏堵塞掉了，也是寒。你的末梢如果太冷的时候，血会结块。所以用炮附子下去，很热就化掉了。所以当病人四逆，手脚冰冷的，下痢不止，我们知道里寒很盛，看到他里寒的时候就赶快治，不治好动脉血管会剥离。"}]},{"ID":"20240311113208-i1a5mkf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240311113208-i1a5mkf","updated":"20240311130658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"228、怎么知道他有虫？"}]},{"ID":"20240311130703-zal08r5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240311130703-zal08r5"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"一个百虫窝穴，有压痛点。"}]},{"ID":"20240311130705-lk592pe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240311130705-lk592pe"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第二个唇内牙龈的地方，有很多白点，成串的白点。"}]},{"ID":"20240311130708-rkapa1h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240311130708-rkapa1h","updated":"20240311130718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第三个眼睛眼白有蓝点或黑点。这就百分之七十五有虫了；"}]},{"ID":"20240311130718-xq0iwd2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240311130718-xq0iwd2","updated":"20240311130800"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第四个肛门痒，晚上睡觉的时候肛门很痒，肛门痒可能是虫，也可能是痔疮在痒。"}]},{"ID":"20240311130816-3cuoqyx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240311130816-3cuoqyx","updated":"20240311130823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第五个大便会排出虫。"}]},{"ID":"20240311130900-fxcanjt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240311130900-fxcanjt","updated":"20240311130903"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"228.1、小朋友肚子有虫，肚子会比较大一点。"}]},{"ID":"20240311130735-bgnfbg4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240311130735-bgnfbg4","updated":"20240311130930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"229、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"厥阴症出现的时候，如果看到病人有中风，就是太阳中风，不是半边瘫痪的中风，看到有太阳病的症状，就知道这个病会好。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240311144252-7xv5mrm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240311144252-7xv5mrm","updated":"20240311152622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"229.1、病情如果到厥阴症的时候，有发热的现象都是好现象，若发热后又冷了，这就是热深厥亦深。当热到极限的时候，会看到寒症；"}]},{"ID":"20240311152623-xx1nfhi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240311152623-xx1nfhi","updated":"20240311152628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"229.2、厥阴证一定有寒热交接，当寒很盛的时候，热一定要找地方宣泄，一个是排脓血，不是往上胸胁烦满，就是后面大便带血。因为里寒很盛，热没办法呆在里面往外走。"}]},{"ID":"20240311130925-0n44zhg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240311130925-0n44zhg","updated":"20240311144601"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"230、厥阴证：寒热病结；阴阳气不相接；"}]},{"ID":"20240311131334-pbbbh14","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240311131334-pbbbh14","updated":"20240311144746"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"231、腹水由来：肝有问题的时候，中间横隔，比如脾脏胰脏有问题的时候，梗在中间，水道不通，水不断的气化，结果到横隔就梗到，肚子越来越大，上面很干，水上不来。喝水下去没有办法去产生水，在里面梗到，他又渴，喝不下去，中间梗到，水在下面不断累积起来，腹水是这样来的；"}]},{"ID":"20240311144747-ege7c9a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240311144747-ege7c9a","updated":"20240312101058"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"232、能够点命门火的药，最好的药就是生硫磺；"}]},{"ID":"20240311130930-wu21jjl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240311130930-wu21jjl","updated":"20240312101231"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"233、木通除了通小便，还能通大便；"}]},{"ID":"20240312101231-nk6eupy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312101231-nk6eupy","updated":"20240312101348"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"234、排腹水的时候，甘草，大黄，芒硝都不用，因为厥阴篇忌下，绝对不能攻下的；"}]},{"ID":"20240312101348-t542jdn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312101348-t542jdn","updated":"20240312101746"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"235、文字稿：在治癌症的时候，第一要求，不要病人做任何的检查的动作，不要做切片栓塞，什么都不要做。第二个要求就是，不要回去做体检了。中医得标准是，里面可能还有其他的变症在里面，可是这个人能吃能喝能拉能睡，即使肝癌的肿瘤还在，可能十年才长指甲那么大一个，你就不要小题大做了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312101229-vhpqnzy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312101229-vhpqnzy"}}]}